7. Budget adherence: With a global budget of 3 million euros over 4 years, closely monitoring actual expenditure versus planned expenditure will help ensure we stay within the allocated budget.

By focusing on these KPIs, we can effectively measure the project's success in meeting the City of Belval's objectives while leveraging our company's strengths in AI solutions and public sector IT.
